<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila's Shell cuts most local fuel prices.</title>
<headline>Manila's Shell cuts most local fuel prices.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pilipinas Shell Petroleum Corp (PSPC) announced on Friday that it will reduce prices of most petroleum products except regular gasoline, a company statement said.</p>
<p>The company said the price of diesel will be cut the most by 65 centavos per litre, followed by jet fuel by 43 centavos and kerosene by 38 centavos.</p>
</text>
